# Streamerdesk ASMR Suite @SUITE_VERSION@ — macOS

**ES** · Seis filtros de audio para **OBS Studio 28 o posterior** pensados para ASMR, para **macOS 11+** universal (**Apple Silicon e Intel**). Gratis y de código abierto, hecho con cariño por Streamerdesk — https://streamerdesk.com

**EN** · Six audio filters for **OBS Studio 28 or later**, made for ASMR, for **macOS 11+**, universal (**Apple Silicon and Intel**). Free and open source, lovingly made by Streamerdesk — https://streamerdesk.com

| Efecto / Effect | Versión | Módulo / Bundle |
|---|---|---|
@TABLE@

## Instalar (español)
Cierra OBS Studio y elige **una** de estas dos formas:

- **`Instalar - Install.command`** (recomendado): doble clic, marca los efectos que quieras (vienen todos marcados; Cmd-clic para quitar o añadir) y pulsa **Instalar**. Quita la cuarentena de Gatekeeper por ti y no pide contraseña.
- **`StreamerdeskASMR-Suite-@SUITE_VERSION@-macos.pkg`**: el instalador clásico de macOS. En **Tipo de instalación > Personalizar** eliges los efectos. Pide tu contraseña de administrador porque deja una copia en `/Library/Application Support/Streamerdesk/ASMR/` y la copia a tu usuario.

Después abre OBS, clic derecho en tu micrófono > **Filtros** > **+** y busca los efectos **Streamerdesk ASMR**.

- Los plugins se instalan en `~/Library/Application Support/obs-studio/plugins/`.
- **Tus presets se conservan siempre** (`~/Library/Application Support/obs-studio/plugin_config/…/presets.json`): ni el instalador ni el desinstalador los tocan.
- Para quitar efectos: **`Desinstalar - Uninstall.command`**.
- Instalación manual: copia los `.plugin` de la carpeta `Plugins/` a la carpeta de plugins de arriba.

## Install (English)
Quit OBS Studio and pick **one** of these:

- **`Instalar - Install.command`** (recommended): double-click, tick the effects you want (all are selected; Cmd-click to add or remove) and click **Install**. It removes the Gatekeeper quarantine for you and needs no password.
- **`StreamerdeskASMR-Suite-@SUITE_VERSION@-macos.pkg`**: the classic macOS installer. Choose effects under **Installation Type > Customize**. It asks for your admin password because it keeps a copy in `/Library/Application Support/Streamerdesk/ASMR/` and copies it into your user folder.

Then open OBS, right-click your microphone > **Filters** > **+** and look for the **Streamerdesk ASMR** effects.

- Plugins are installed into `~/Library/Application Support/obs-studio/plugins/`.
- **Your presets are always kept** (`~/Library/Application Support/obs-studio/plugin_config/…/presets.json`); the installer and uninstaller never touch them.
- To remove effects: **`Desinstalar - Uninstall.command`**.
- Manual install: copy the `.plugin` bundles from the `Plugins/` folder into the plugins folder above.

